---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
description: Ming Lab at City University of Hong Kong studies cancer mechanisms, epigenetics, spatial tumor-nerve interactions and AI-assisted approaches for translational cancer research.
permalink: /
fullBleed: true
---
<section class="home-hero">
  <div class="home-hero-inner">
    <div class="home-hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Ming Lab · City University of Hong Kong</p>
      <h1>Decoding cancer mechanisms from chromatin to spatial tumor ecology.</h1>
      <p class="home-hero-lede">We combine wet-lab molecular experiments, multi-omics, spatial biology and AI-assisted analysis to move from basic cancer mechanisms toward clinically useful interventions.</p>
      <div class="home-actions" aria-label="Primary">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/research/">Explore Research</a>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/contact/">Join the Lab</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <figure class="home-hero-figure">
      <img src="/assets/research/ai.webp" alt="Tissue section colour-coded into regions by AI-assisted analysis">
      <figcaption>AI-assisted spatial analysis for cancer research</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-section home-section--intro">
  <div class="home-section-inner">
    <p class="home-statement">Our laboratory studies how genetic, epigenetic and spatial tissue-level mechanisms shape cancer progression, with a growing focus on tumor-nerve interactions and digital pathology for nerve invasion.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-section">
  <div class="home-section-inner">
    <div class="section-kicker">
      <p class="eyebrow">Research</p>
      <h2>Five directions, one translational thread</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="home-research-grid">
      {% for topic in research.topics %}
      <article class="home-research-card">
        <h3>{{ topic.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ topic.paragraphs[0] }}</p>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <p class="home-link-row"><a href="/research/">View all research directions</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-section home-section--muted">
  <div class="home-section-inner">
    <div class="section-kicker">
      <p class="eyebrow">Selected Publications</p>
      <h2>Recent work from the lab</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="home-publication-list">
      {% for paper in publications.papers %}
      {% if loop.index <= 2 %}
      {% set link = paper.url if paper.url else "https://doi.org/" + paper.doi %}
      <article class="home-publication">
        <p class="home-publication-year">{{ paper.year }}</p>
        <h3><a href="{{ link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ paper.title }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ paper.journal }}</p>
      </article>
      {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <p class="home-link-row"><a href="/publications/">Browse publications</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-section home-join">
  <div class="home-section-inner home-join-inner">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Opportunities</p>
      <h2>Join a wet-dry cancer biology lab</h2>
    </div>
    <p>We welcome motivated postdoctoral fellows, research assistants and postgraduate students interested in molecular cancer biology, spatial analysis, AI-assisted pathology and translational discovery.</p>
    <a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Contact Us</a>
  </div>
</section>
